{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game is still in progress !</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Ink &amp; Cursor is a cozy, creature collector and deck builder like game in which you need to save animals from the spreading ink and invasive monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the cursor as your controller, combine, assemble and fix the world of dozens of hand drawn animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple click-and-move gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai simulation that allows the animals to move on their own, flee from enemies when injured, find food and more !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that seek and attack your animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight biomes with unique flora and design to uncover and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings, such as lamps to keep the Ink at bay and little farms to grow food. You just need to find the recipe for them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full recipe book, which will eventually reach a grand total of 58 hand-drawn animals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934830/extras/bed21bc5f450776e3708dbe301dd31d0.poster.avif?t=1756848494\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934830/extras/bed21bc5f450776e3708dbe301dd31d0.webm?t=1756848494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934830/extras/bed21bc5f450776e3708dbe301dd31d0.mp4?t=1756848494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this first little project from Paperfox Entertainment!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934830?t=1756848494","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934830?t=1756848494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934830/ee587c97eea0b687abe757d57c5d2ac3ba7ddcf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756848494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934830/ee587c97eea0b687abe757d57c5d2ac3ba7ddcf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756848494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game is still in progress !</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Ink &amp; Cursor is a cozy, creature collector and deck builder like game in which you need to save animals from the spreading ink and invasive monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the cursor as your controller, combine, assemble and fix the world of dozens of hand drawn animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple click-and-move gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai simulation that allows the animals to move on their own, flee from enemies when injured, find food and more !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that seek and attack your animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight biomes with unique flora and design to uncover and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings, such as lamps to keep the Ink at bay and little farms to grow food. You just need to find the recipe for them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full recipe book, which will eventually reach a grand total of 58 hand-drawn animals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu